        <p><strong>BE-02</strong><span>SQLite CRUD, persistence, and six tests</span></p>
        <p><strong>BE-03</strong><span>Supabase Auth, verified JWTs, and protected routes</span></p>
        <p><strong>BE-04</strong><span>PostgreSQL, Docker Compose, and layered architecture</span></p>
      </div>
